"""
Sealed T1 gauge-cocycle machine battery.

Protocol:
  1. Commit the preregistration document.
  2. Commit this runner as the immediately following commit.
  3. Run, for example:

     python3 t1_battery.py \
       --prereg path/to/T1_prereg.md \
       --note path/to/T1_note.md \
       --artifact runs/T1_battery.json

The runner emits no verdict to stdout. The verdict and all evidence are written
to the new artifact named by --artifact. Existing artifacts are never replaced.

Arithmetic is exact. Only the Python standard library is used.
"""

